sequenceDiagram
    actor Member
    actor Admin
    participant Site
    participant Record as Record <<database>>

    Member->>Site: Find sessions that cannot be attended

    alt Member chooses cancellation
        Member->>Site: Request cancellation of session
        Site->>Record: Update attendance status and save changes
        Record-->>Admin: Notify of changes
        Site-->>Member: Final confirmation cancellation complete
    else Member chooses makeup session
        Member->>Site: Request makeup sessions with capacity check
        Site->>Record: Update attendance status and save changes
        Record-->>Admin: Notify of changes
        Record-->>Site: Update member schedule
        Site-->>Member: Final confirmation with details
    end
